# Skills for {{ package_name }}

Agent skills for this project live here, following the `.agents/skills/` cross-tool convention that
Codex, Copilot, Gemini CLI, opencode, Cursor and most other agents read directly. Claude Code reads
only `.claude/skills/`, which is committed as a relative symlink to this directory, so a skill
placed here is picked up by every agent.

No skills are installed by default. Add one as a subdirectory here and it's live immediately, no
separate registration step.
